00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:25.519
and I wanted to ask her out or, you know

00:01:25.519 --> 00:01:28.770
in those days I was in sixth
grade and you would just say

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:30.210
do you want to go steady, right away?

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:31.260
Yeah, you know steady.

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:33.000
And then you'd give him a
Saint Christopher metal.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.341
- [Rita] Oh my God.

00:01:34.341 --> 00:01:35.174
- Did you remember doing that?

00:01:35.174 --> 00:01:36.007
- Yes, I had a turquoise, from Brad.

00:01:36.007 --> 00:01:37.866
- [Kelly] You did a what?

00:01:37.866 --> 00:01:39.018
- It's a Christopher Medel.

00:01:39.018 --> 00:01:39.851
- Metal.
- Metal.

00:01:39.851 --> 00:01:41.010
