00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:41.880
- [Rita] Yes exactly, yeah.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.740
- [Kelly] You just
bring religion right in.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:44.573
- [Brian] I know.

00:01:44.573 --> 00:01:45.406
- I like it, I like it.

00:01:45.406 --> 00:01:47.490
- I don't what it meant,
but, and that's what it was.

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:50.940
And unfortunately at a party,

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:53.960
I hesitated and some new guy
in his class walked right

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:55.950
