00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:56.899
And she said, yes.

00:01:56.899 --> 00:01:59.555
I went, and that song was playing.

00:01:59.555 --> 00:02:00.540
- [Kelly] Oh no.

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:04.012
