in slow motion at that time.

00:02:04.012 --> 00:02:08.506
And it was like, oh my
God, that just happened.

00:02:08.506 --> 00:02:11.028
And I was like

00:02:11.028 --> 00:02:14.203
- So wait, so wait.

00:02:14.203 --> 00:02:16.906
- Wow, that was so nice.

00:02:16.906 --> 00:02:18.329
- So wait, do you like

00:02:18.329 --> 00:02:22.740
do you like going to these
nostalgic sad moments often?

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:23.573
- [Rita] Yes.

00:02:23.573 --> 00:02:25.158
